language 0.1.0
module system
  means
    General notions of a software system, its large constituent parts, the
    capabilities it provides and the parties involved, independent of any
    technical representation or lifecycle stage.

entity app : thing
  means
    app: a software system providing a coherent set of capabilities to
    definite users or to other systems.

entity component : thing
  means
    component: a replaceable part of an app with an explicitly defined
    responsibility and interaction boundary.

entity service : thing
  means
    service: a component providing its capabilities through a programmatic
    interface at run time.

entity capability : thing
  means
    capability: an observable ability of a system to achieve a definite
    outcome, without stating how it is achieved.

entity user : thing
  means
    user: a subject interacting with an app directly in order to reach a goal.

entity organization : thing
  means
    organization: a lasting association of subjects holding an identity and
    responsibility of its own.

entity environment : thing
  means
    environment: a named set of operating conditions for an app, such as
    development or production.
